; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  2516  **                   and non re-entrant for other transitions.                **
; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  2517  **                                                                            **
; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  2518  ** Parameters (in) : McuMode : Mcu Mode number as configured in the           **
; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  2519  **                   configuration set                                        **
; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  2520  **                                                                            **
; ..\MCAL364\Mcu\ssc\src\Mcu.c	  2521  ** Parameters (out): None                                                     **
